ledger: ZXV_OK
accounts: bank 0, alice 1, bob 2
^ZXPAY(7) node 2 ZXV_OK
^ZXPAY(7,1) node 1 ZXV_OK
  post entry 1
^ZXPAY(7,2) node 1 ZXV_OK
  post entry 2
^ZXPAY(7,3) node 1 ZXV_OK
  post ZXV_E_FUNDS
^ZXPAY(7,4) node 1 ZXV_OK
  post ZXV_E_DUPLICATE
^ZXPAY(7,5) node 1 ZM_E_DATA: piece 2 (amount): "12.50" is not a number in M canonical form
^ZXPAY(7,6) node 1 ZM_E_FIT: piece 2 (amount): 1.005 has more than 2 decimals (never rounded)
^ZXPAY(7,7) node 1 ZXV_OK
  post ZXV_E_CURRENCY
^ZXPAY(7,"X") node - ZM_E_KEY: ^ZXPAY(7,"X") matches no node of ^ZXPAY: subscript 2: subscript "X" is a string; key seq is a number
^ZXPAY("B","FUND-ALICE",7,1) node 3 ZXV_OK
^ZXPAY("B","PAY-0001",7,2) node 3 ZXV_OK
^ZXPAY("B","PAY-0001",7,4) node 3 ZXV_OK
^ZXPAY("B","PAY-0002",7,3) node 3 ZXV_OK
^ZXPAY("B","PAY-0003",7,5) node 3 ZXV_OK
^ZXPAY("B","PAY-0004",7,6) node 3 ZXV_OK
^ZXPAY("B","PAY-0005",7,7) node 3 ZXV_OK
amount of ^ZXPAY(7,2): 250.25
value-date: 2026-10-11 (M says 2026-10-11)
index key ref: PAY-0001
put status P: ZXV_OK -> FUND-ALICE^1000^NGN^0^1^67854^P
put amount 0250.250: ZXV_OK -> PAY-0001^250.25^NGN^1^2^67854^N^^synthetic memo
put amount 1/3: ZM_E_FIT (amount: 1/3 has no exact decimal with 2 places (never rounded))
put memo a^b: ZM_E_DATA
put on the refused ^ZXPAY(7,5): ZM_E_DATA
after +$piece: PAY-0003^12.5^NGN^1^2^67854^N ZXV_OK
  post entry 3
post ^ZXPAY(8,1) by its reference: entry 4
collate 10 vs 9: 1, "10" vs "9A": -1, -1 vs "": 1
canonic .5 1, 0.5 0, 1E3 0
equity (kobo): bank -100000, alice 73425, bob 26575
ledger check: ZXV_OK
revoke the poster cap: ZXV_OK
post after revoke: ZXV_E_CAP
